Start

Input number
count = 0

While number > 0
    number = number / 10
    count = count + 1
End while

Print Number of digits = count

If count = 1 
    Print "Single-digit number"
Else if count = 2 
    Print "Double-digit number"
Else if count = 3 
    Print "Triple-digit number"
Else
    Print "Four-digit or more number"
End if

Stop
